msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:ConstantForce"
msgid "常に一定で掛かる風の強さ。上げるとボーンが風下へ流されたままになる。Wind Scope の Constant 系列に対応\nConstant wind strength that always applies. Higher values keep bones pushed downwind. Corresponds to the Constant series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "常に一定で掛かる風の強さ。上げるとボーンが風下へ流されたままになる。Wind Scope の Constant 系列に対応\nConstant wind strength that always applies. Higher values keep bones pushed downwind. Corresponds to the Constant series in Wind Scope."

