msgid "揺らぎが変化する周期（秒）。短いほど細かく震える。Wind Scope の Random 系列に対応\nPeriod at which the fluctuation changes, in seconds. Shorter values jitter faster. Corresponds to the Random series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "揺らぎが変化する周期（秒）。短いほど細かく震える。Wind Scope の Random 系列に対応\nPeriod at which the fluctuation changes, in seconds. Shorter values jitter faster. Corresponds to the Random series in Wind Scope."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce
