#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleForce"
msgid "根元から毛先へ伝播する波揺れ(Ripple)の振幅。伝播の要は RippleTipPhaseDelay で、0 だと Sway と同じ動きになる。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nAmplitude of the wave that travels from root to tip. RippleTipPhaseDelay drives the propagation; at 0 the motion matches Sway. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "根元から毛先へ伝播する波揺れ(Ripple)の振幅。伝播の要は RippleTipPhaseDelay で、0 だと Sway と同じ動きになる。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nAmplitude of the wave that travels from root to tip. RippleTipPhaseDelay drives the propagation; at 0 the motion matches Sway. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePeriod
