msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePeriod"
msgid "波揺れ(Ripple)の周期（秒）。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nPeriod of the traveling wave, in seconds. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "波揺れ(Ripple)の周期（秒）。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nPeriod of the traveling wave, in seconds. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."

