#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePhaseOffset [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RipplePhaseOffset"
msgid "波揺れ(Ripple)の開始位相オフセット。複数キャラや複数外力で波のタイミングを分散する用途。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nStart phase offset of the traveling wave. Use to stagger wave timing across multiple characters or external forces. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "波揺れ(Ripple)の開始位相オフセット。複数キャラや複数外力で波のタイミングを分散する用途。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nStart phase offset of the traveling wave. Use to stagger wave timing across multiple characters or external forces. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay"
msgid "Ripple Tip Phase Delay"
msgstr "Ripple Tip Phase Delay"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysics_ExternalForce_ProceduralWind:RippleTipPhaseDelay"
msgid "毛先（LengthRate=1）での位相遅れ角。伝播の要で、0 だと Sway と同じ動きになる。波が根元から毛先へ走り抜ける時間 = RipplePeriod × (TipPhaseDelay/360°)。負値で毛先→根元へ逆走。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nPhase delay at the tip (LengthRate=1). This drives the propagation; at 0 the motion matches Sway. Travel time from root to tip = RipplePeriod x (TipPhaseDelay/360deg). Negative values make the wave travel from tip to root. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."
msgstr "毛先（LengthRate=1）での位相遅れ角。伝播の要で、0 だと Sway と同じ動きになる。波が根元から毛先へ走り抜ける時間 = RipplePeriod × (TipPhaseDelay/360°)。負値で毛先→根元へ逆走。Wind Scope の Ripple 系列に対応\nPhase delay at the tip (LengthRate=1). This drives the propagation; at 0 the motion matches Sway. Travel time from root to tip = RipplePeriod x (TipPhaseDelay/360deg). Negative values make the wave travel from tip to root. Corresponds to the Ripple series in Wind Scope."

