#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "World Damping Location"
msgstr "World Damping Location"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の移動量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 移動量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space movement.\n0 = movement fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)."
msgstr "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の移動量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 移動量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space movement.\n0 = movement fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingLocation)."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "World Damping Rotation"
msgstr "World Damping Rotation"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettings:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の回転量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 回転量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space rotation.\n0 = rotation fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)."
msgstr "ワールド座標系における Skeletal Mesh Component の回転量のダンピング(抑制)量。\n0 = 回転量をフル反映(揺れ最大) / 1 = コンポーネントに追従(反映なし)。実際の反映率 = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)\nDamping (suppression) of the Skeletal Mesh Component's world-space rotation.\n0 = rotation fully reflected (max sway) / 1 = follows component (no reflection). Actual reflection factor = (1 - WorldDampingRotation)."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier [ScriptStruct DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier [ScriptStruct DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier"
msgid "Kawaii Physics Settings Multiplier"
msgstr "Kawaii Physics Settings Multiplier"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier"
msgid "物理設定への一時的な倍率。全項目の既定値 1.0 は「変更なし」。ベースの設定値は書き換えず、毎フレーム再計算される各ボーンの実効値に乗算する\nTemporary multipliers for physics settings. Every value defaults to 1.0 (no change). The base settings are never rewritten;\nthe multipliers are applied to each bone's effective values, which are recomputed every frame."
msgstr "物理設定への一時的な倍率。全項目の既定値 1.0 は「変更なし」。ベースの設定値は書き換えず、毎フレーム再計算される各ボーンの実効値に乗算する\nTemporary multipliers for physics settings. Every value defaults to 1.0 (no change). The base settings are never rewritten;\nthe multipliers are applied to each bone's effective values, which are recomputed every frame."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping"
msgid "Damping"
msgstr "Damping"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Damping"
msgid "Dampingへの倍率。1未満で減衰が弱まり、揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for Damping. Below 1 the damping weakens and the sway grows."
msgstr "Dampingへの倍率。1未満で減衰が弱まり、揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for Damping. Below 1 the damping weakens and the sway grows."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle"
msgid "Limit Angle"
msgstr "Limit Angle"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:LimitAngle"
msgid "LimitAngleへの倍率。ベースが0（無制限）のボーンは倍率に関わらず無制限のまま。ベースが0より大きいボーンは\n極小値で下限クランプされ、倍率0でも無制限へは反転せず、ほぼ完全にポーズへ追従する\nMultiplier for LimitAngle. Bones whose base value is 0 (unlimited) stay unlimited whatever the multiplier is.\nBones with a base above 0 are clamped to a tiny positive minimum, so even a multiplier of 0 never flips them back to\nunlimited; they follow the pose almost exactly instead."
msgstr "LimitAngleへの倍率。ベースが0（無制限）のボーンは倍率に関わらず無制限のまま。ベースが0より大きいボーンは\n極小値で下限クランプされ、倍率0でも無制限へは反転せず、ほぼ完全にポーズへ追従する\nMultiplier for LimitAngle. Bones whose base value is 0 (unlimited) stay unlimited whatever the multiplier is.\nBones with a base above 0 are clamped to a tiny positive minimum, so even a multiplier of 0 never flips them back to\nunlimited; they follow the pose almost exactly instead."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius"
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "Radius"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Radius"
msgid "コリジョン半径への倍率。0にするとワールドコリジョンのスイープと押し出しが実質無効になる。\n半径によるダミーボーンの本数はベースの半径から決まるため、1未満ではコリジョンの被覆に隙間が生じうる\nMultiplier for the collision radius. At 0 the world sweep and push-out are effectively disabled.\nThe radius-based dummy bone count comes from the base radius, so below 1 the collision coverage can leave gaps."
msgstr "コリジョン半径への倍率。0にするとワールドコリジョンのスイープと押し出しが実質無効になる。\n半径によるダミーボーンの本数はベースの半径から決まるため、1未満ではコリジョンの被覆に隙間が生じうる\nMultiplier for the collision radius. At 0 the world sweep and push-out are effectively disabled.\nThe radius-based dummy bone count comes from the base radius, so below 1 the collision coverage can leave gaps."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness"
msgid "Stiffness"
msgstr "Stiffness"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:Stiffness"
msgid "Stiffnessへの倍率。1未満で元の形状への引き戻しが弱まり、揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for Stiffness. Below 1 the pull back to the pre-physics shape weakens and the sway grows."
msgstr "Stiffnessへの倍率。1未満で元の形状への引き戻しが弱まり、揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for Stiffness. Below 1 the pull back to the pre-physics shape weakens and the sway grows."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "World Damping Location"
msgstr "World Damping Location"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingLocation"
msgid "WorldDampingLocationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingLocation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの移動量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingLocation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingLocation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component movement and increases the sway."
msgstr "WorldDampingLocationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingLocation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの移動量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingLocation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingLocation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component movement and increases the sway."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "World Damping Rotation"
msgstr "World Damping Rotation"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation [FloatProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplier:WorldDampingRotation"
msgid "WorldDampingRotationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingRotation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの回転量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingRotation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingRotation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component rotation and increases the sway."
msgstr "WorldDampingRotationへの倍率。実際の反映率は (1 - WorldDampingRotation) のため意味が反転し、\n1未満の倍率ではコンポーネントの回転量がより強く反映されて揺れが大きくなる\nMultiplier for WorldDampingRotation. The semantics are inverted because the actual reflection factor is\n(1 - WorldDampingRotation): a multiplier below 1 reflects more of the component rotation and increases the sway."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone
