#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone [ScriptStruct DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone"
msgid "Kawaii Physics Sync Bone"
msgstr "Kawaii Physics Sync Bone"

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysics.KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone [ScriptStruct ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone"
msgid "SyncBone：同期元のボーンの移動・回転を物理制御下のボーンに適用します。\nスカートが足などを貫通するのを防ぐのに役立ちます\nApplies the movement and rotation of the sync source bone to the bone under physics control.\nHelps prevent skirts from penetrating legs, etc."
msgstr "SyncBone：同期元のボーンの移動・回転を物理制御下のボーンに適用します。\nスカートが足などを貫通するのを防ぐのに役立ちます\nApplies the movement and rotation of the sync source bone to the bone under physics control.\nHelps prevent skirts from penetrating legs, etc."

#. Key:	KawaiiPhysicsSyncBone:ApplyDirectionX
