msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,KawaiiPhysicsTransientHandle"
msgid "一時効果（一時外力・突風・物理設定倍率）の停止用ハンドル。Id=0 は未設定。ノード再初期化や上限超過破棄で対象が消えた後も値は残り、その場合の停止要求は何もしない\nHandle used to stop transient effects (transient external forces, gusts, physics settings multipliers). Id=0 means unset. The value survives after the target is lost (node re-init or cap eviction); stop requests then do nothing."
msgstr "一時効果（一時外力・突風・物理設定倍率）の停止用ハンドル。Id=0 は未設定。ノード再初期化や上限超過破棄で対象が消えた後も値は残り、その場合の停止要求は何もしない\nHandle used to stop transient effects (transient external forces, gusts, physics settings multipliers). Id=0 means unset. The value survives after the target is lost (node re-init or cap eviction); stop requests then do nothing."

