#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
