msgstr "Limit Angle"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:LimitAngle"
msgid "LimitAngleへの倍率。ベースが0（無制限）のボーンは倍率に関わらず無制限のまま。ベースが0より大きいボーンは\n極小値で下限クランプされ、倍率0でも無制限へは反転せず、ほぼ完全にポーズへ追従する\nMultiplier for LimitAngle. Bones whose base value is 0 (unlimited) stay unlimited whatever the multiplier is.\nBones with a base above 0 are clamped to a tiny positive minimum, so even a multiplier of 0 never flips them back to\nunlimited; they follow the pose almost exactly instead."
msgstr "LimitAngleへの倍率。ベースが0（無制限）のボーンは倍率に関わらず無制限のまま。ベースが0より大きいボーンは\n極小値で下限クランプされ、倍率0でも無制限へは反転せず、ほぼ完全にポーズへ追従する\nMultiplier for LimitAngle. Bones whose base value is 0 (unlimited) stay unlimited whatever the multiplier is.\nBones with a base above 0 are clamped to a tiny positive minimum, so even a multiplier of 0 never flips them back to\nunlimited; they follow the pose almost exactly instead."

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius [StructProperty DisplayName meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectDisplayNames,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius"
msgid "Radius"
msgstr "Radius"

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius
#. SourceLocation:	/Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
#: /Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Radius"
msgid "コリジョン半径への倍率。0にするとワールドコリジョンのスイープと押し出しが実質無効になる。\n半径によるダミーボーンの本数はベースの半径から決まるため、1未満ではコリジョンの被覆に隙間が生じうる\nMultiplier for the collision radius. At 0 the world sweep and push-out are effectively disabled.\nThe radius-based dummy bone count comes from the base radius, so below 1 the collision coverage can leave gaps."
msgstr "コリジョン半径への倍率。0にするとワールドコリジョンのスイープと押し出しが実質無効になる。\n半径によるダミーボーンの本数はベースの半径から決まるため、1未満ではコリジョンの被覆に隙間が生じうる\nMultiplier for the collision radius. At 0 the world sweep and push-out are effectively disabled.\nThe radius-based dummy bone count comes from the base radius, so below 1 the collision coverage can leave gaps."

#. Key:	MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Stiffness
