#: /Script/KawaiiPhysicsSequencer.MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Stiffness [StructProperty ToolTip meta-data]
msgctxt "UObjectToolTips,MovieSceneKawaiiPhysicsSettingsMultiplierSection:Stiffness"
msgid "Stiffnessへの倍率。1未満で元の形状への引き戻しが弱まり、揺れが大きくなる / Multiplier for Stiffness. Below 1 the pull back to the pre-physics shape weakens and the sway grows."
msgstr "Stiffnessへの倍率。1未満で元の形状への引き戻しが弱まり、揺れが大きくなる / Multiplier for Stiffness. Below 1 the pull back to the pre-physics shape weakens and the sway grows."

